ich maps to <MATH_0055> under <MATH_0056>.\nFinally, if <MATH_0057> and <MATH_0058> are deformations of <MATH_0059> and <MATH_0060>\nand there exists an isomorphism <MATH_0061> of deformations\nof <MATH_0062> then we get a preimage\n<MATH_0063> of <MATH_0064> in <MATH_0065>.\nThis finishes the proof.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5077d3d7d9d325a9b8c318defc050d98d21696a8c5b075f8643f09e92c575f55", "unit_id": "tag:06L5:proof"}
