initesimal automorphisms and Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6d348abd693690ae0fb60550d0d178c1506d45a876fef1870dbc1a1f6e1bb329", "unit_id": "tag:0DYN:proof"}
